WEBVTT

00:01.910 --> 00:02.870
<b>Wait.</b>

00:05.960 --> 00:06.840
<b>Okay.</b>

00:27.940 --> 00:30.030
<b><i>Mitchan.</i></b>

00:30.110 --> 00:31.990
<b><i>Where did she disappear to?</i></b>

00:36.910 --> 00:38.780
<b>I should have…</b>

00:38.870 --> 00:41.040
<b>eaten more of that omelette.</b>

00:45.960 --> 00:47.540
<b>Are you…</b>

00:47.630 --> 00:48.630
<b>giving it to me?</b>

02:29.140 --> 02:31.310
<b>Are you sure, Dali?</b>

02:31.400 --> 02:32.230
<b>Yes.</b>

02:33.440 --> 02:35.110
<b><i>In the hidden attic,</i></b>

02:35.190 --> 02:37.570
<b><i>we found a diorama of Origon Village.</i></b>

02:37.650 --> 02:40.740
<b><i>The Ichijos have</i>
<i>kept the villagers under surveillance.</i></b>

02:41.370 --> 02:42.820
<b><i>Including us.</i></b>

02:45.410 --> 02:46.370
<b>Migi.</b>

02:46.450 --> 02:48.710
<b>It's too dangerous to stay here.</b>

02:48.790 --> 02:51.080
<b>We must return to base
and rethink our strategy.</b>

02:51.170 --> 02:52.250
<b>Dali.</b>

02:52.330 --> 02:54.670
<b>Please leave the rest up to me.</b>

02:55.840 --> 02:57.090
<b>No, Migi.</b>

02:57.170 --> 02:58.550
<b>The two of us are one.</b>

02:59.260 --> 03:01.640
<b>The only way for us
to find Mother's murderer</b>

03:01.720 --> 03:04.930
<b>is for the two of us
to turn their guts inside out.</b>

03:05.010 --> 03:06.560
<b>Right now,</b>

03:06.640 --> 03:08.980
<b>I can make them open up to me.</b>

03:10.440 --> 03:11.140
<b>But how?</b>

03:12.100 --> 03:13.730
<b>I can't tell you.</b>

03:18.190 --> 03:20.110
<b>There, there.</b>

03:20.200 --> 03:21.410
<b>Mommy.</b>

03:21.490 --> 03:24.740
<b>I'm just a toddler,
I don't know anything at all.</b>

03:24.830 --> 03:28.040
<b>Please tell me everything about this home.</b>

03:29.370 --> 03:30.830
<b>Tell me.</b>

03:30.910 --> 03:33.630
<b>Tell me about everyone.</b>

03:34.790 --> 03:36.960
<b>Let me tell you this.</b>

03:37.050 --> 03:38.590
<b>A little toddler</b>

03:38.670 --> 03:40.670
<b>doesn't talk like that.</b>

03:40.760 --> 03:44.550
<b>It's actually overacting when you do this.</b>

03:51.270 --> 03:52.980
<b><i>For crying out loud.</i></b>

03:53.770 --> 03:56.190
<b><i>I was going to become the perfect toddler,</i></b>

03:56.270 --> 03:59.190
<b><i>and make that woman let down her guard,</i></b>

04:01.150 --> 04:04.450
<b><i>for me to turn her guts inside out. </i></b>

04:06.070 --> 04:08.240
<b>But I am overacting, she says?</b>

04:08.330 --> 04:11.830
<b><i>In other words,</i>
<i>I am not yet a proper toddler.</i></b>

04:12.460 --> 04:13.540
<b><i>Well then.</i></b>

04:14.170 --> 04:16.040
<b><i>I'll show her real acting.</i></b>

04:16.130 --> 04:18.460
<b><i>I am the king of copycats!</i></b>

04:34.940 --> 04:37.310
<b>You cannot eat that.</b>

04:45.860 --> 04:48.910
<b>You are supposed to
put them on top of each other like this.</b>

04:50.950 --> 04:52.200
<b>Okay?</b>

04:54.250 --> 04:57.670
<b><i>That's good, this is the way to go.</i></b>

04:58.340 --> 04:59.630
<b><i>I will</i></b>

04:59.710 --> 05:01.590
<b><i>become</i></b>

05:01.670 --> 05:04.050
<b><i>absolutely flawless.</i></b>

05:05.220 --> 05:08.930
<b><i>I will surpass the perfect toddler.</i></b>

05:11.100 --> 05:13.930
<b><i>People's actions</i>
<i>reveal their true feelings.</i></b>

05:14.020 --> 05:17.060
<b><i>When you tell a lie</i>
<i>and try to escape from that situation,</i></b>

05:17.150 --> 05:19.900
<b><i>your body movements become restless…</i></b>

05:19.980 --> 05:22.360
<b><i>It will be more noticable</i></b>

05:22.440 --> 05:24.360
<b><i>in parts below the face…</i></b>

05:24.900 --> 05:26.490
<b><i>Are you sure?</i></b>

05:26.570 --> 05:28.780
<b><i>For Migi, it always shows on his face.</i></b>

05:30.330 --> 05:32.740
<b><i>What was that odd sound?</i></b>

05:32.830 --> 05:34.410
<b><i>No one ought to be home right now</i></b>

05:34.500 --> 05:36.580
<b><i>aside from Migi and the mother.</i></b>

05:37.710 --> 05:39.920
<b><i>Could Migi's life be in danger?</i></b>

05:45.050 --> 05:45.920
<b><i>Migi?</i></b>

05:48.510 --> 05:50.720
<b><i>Is he okay?</i></b>

05:55.930 --> 05:57.640
<b>Over here, come on.</b>

05:57.730 --> 05:59.560
<b>Let go now.</b>

05:59.650 --> 06:00.770
<b>That's it.</b>

06:00.860 --> 06:04.400
<b>You got this, you can stand up.</b>

06:04.480 --> 06:06.950
<b>Here we go.</b>

06:07.700 --> 06:08.780
<b>That's good.</b>

06:08.860 --> 06:11.160
<b>-Go on, straight ahead.
-Just a bit more…</b>

06:13.330 --> 06:15.250
<b>A widdle bit…</b>

06:18.250 --> 06:20.960
<b><i>No way… Migi…</i></b>

06:21.040 --> 06:22.960
<b>Mama!</b>

06:28.970 --> 06:30.340
<b><i>Da… li…?</i></b>

06:30.930 --> 06:32.260
<b>What's the matter?</b>

06:33.680 --> 06:35.600
<b><i>You have to do this, Migi.</i></b>

06:35.680 --> 06:37.480
<b><i>Get into character!</i></b>

06:37.560 --> 06:39.850
<b>That's good, keep going.</b>

06:39.940 --> 06:41.360
<b><i>Listen up, Dali.</i></b>

06:41.440 --> 06:43.440
<b><i>Laugh all you want.</i></b>

06:44.690 --> 06:45.530
<b><i>This is </i></b>

06:46.150 --> 06:46.940
<b><i>my</i>…</b>

06:47.030 --> 06:48.490
<b>You're standing!</b>

06:51.160 --> 06:54.370
<b>…<i>master acting!</i></b>

06:59.620 --> 07:01.540
<b>Oh no!</b>

07:01.630 --> 07:03.210
<b>You poor child.</b>

07:03.290 --> 07:05.960
<b>Your head is so heavy
you lost balance, did you?</b>

07:06.590 --> 07:09.930
<b>It hurts but you're not even crying,
what a good boy.</b>

07:10.680 --> 07:14.100
<b>You're a true member of the Ichijo family.</b>

07:14.180 --> 07:15.890
<b><i>That's impressive, Migi.</i></b>

07:16.600 --> 07:19.640
<b><i>You sneakily slithered</i>
<i>right into the Ichijo family.</i></b>

07:19.730 --> 07:21.560
<b><i>We can finally get to the next step.</i></b>

07:21.650 --> 07:24.860
<b><i>The two of us</i>
<i>will turn their guts inside out.</i></b>

07:27.230 --> 07:30.030
<b>Starting today, Hitori will
join us at the dinner table.</b>

07:30.110 --> 07:31.150
<b>How old are you?</b>

07:31.240 --> 07:31.990
<b>I'm five.</b>

07:32.070 --> 07:33.740
<b>Oh, a baby brother.</b>

07:33.820 --> 07:37.240
<b>Eiji and Karen,
teach your baby brother well, okay?</b>

07:37.330 --> 07:38.330
<b>Yes, Mom.</b>

07:38.410 --> 07:39.370
<b>Yes.</b>

07:39.450 --> 07:42.370
<b>Let us begin our family dinner.</b>

07:42.460 --> 07:43.670
<b>-Yes!
-Yes.</b>

07:47.500 --> 07:50.380
<b><i>Let the experiment begin.</i></b>

07:53.430 --> 07:55.050
<b>Mom,</b>

07:55.140 --> 07:57.100
<b>why are spoons round?</b>

07:57.180 --> 07:58.890
<b>It's so you can scoop up your soup.</b>

07:58.970 --> 08:01.060
<b>Why does everyone have the same plates?</b>

08:05.690 --> 08:07.900
<b>He's in his 〝why〞 phase.</b>

08:07.980 --> 08:11.570
<b>If you answer nicely,
his intellectual curiosity will develop.</b>

08:12.650 --> 08:15.280
<b>Don't you think it looks prettier that way?</b>

08:15.370 --> 08:16.870
<b>Hmm.</b>

08:17.530 --> 08:20.080
<b>Why am I the only one
with a different haircolor?</b>

08:23.170 --> 08:26.000
<b>Why? Why is it different
from the rest of the family?</b>

08:26.080 --> 08:28.800
<b>Well, uh, you see…</b>

08:28.880 --> 08:31.300
<b>-Because of second puberty.
-Huh?</b>

08:31.380 --> 08:34.760
<b>When you turn 10 years old,
your hair will change.</b>

08:34.840 --> 08:36.140
<b>Really?</b>

08:36.220 --> 08:37.300
<b>Yes, really.</b>

08:39.100 --> 08:40.390
<b>Pffh.</b>

08:40.470 --> 08:43.350
<b><i>A little lie like that shows no reactions</i>…</b>

08:43.440 --> 08:45.650
<b>Eiji, you're the oldest child,</b>

08:45.730 --> 08:49.400
<b>so why does your name
mean 〝two〞 and not 〝one〞?</b>

08:49.480 --> 08:51.990
<b><i>Good question, Migi.</i></b>

08:52.070 --> 08:53.700
<b>Why?</b>

08:54.860 --> 08:57.910
<b>Because I wanted him to
always aim for number one,</b>

08:57.990 --> 08:59.990
<b>so I let his name remind him of that.</b>

09:00.080 --> 09:03.620
<b>I am proud of the meaning behind my name.</b>

09:04.540 --> 09:06.080
<b><i>He moved.</i></b>

09:06.170 --> 09:08.920
<b><i>He actually wishes his name meant one?</i></b>

09:10.420 --> 09:12.920
<b>You'll wet your bed tonight
if you drink that much.</b>

09:13.010 --> 09:14.300
<b>I won't!</b>

09:16.300 --> 09:19.430
<b>Eiji, do you wet your bed sometimes too?</b>

09:19.510 --> 09:21.180
<b>I'm 13 years old.</b>

09:21.270 --> 09:22.720
<b>Of course I don't.</b>

09:23.310 --> 09:25.350
<b>Is that true?</b>

09:26.310 --> 09:27.440
<b>Is it, Karen?</b>

09:27.520 --> 09:29.360
<b>He's my amazing big brother.</b>

09:29.440 --> 09:31.400
<b>Of course he doesn't.</b>

09:31.940 --> 09:33.690
<b>Is it really true, Mommy?</b>

09:33.780 --> 09:34.610
<b>It is.</b>

09:34.700 --> 09:36.990
<b>Eiji's sheets are always</b>

09:37.070 --> 09:38.820
<b>as white as a field of snow.</b>

09:38.910 --> 09:42.580
<b>I have never once wet my bed.</b>

09:49.960 --> 09:51.880
<b><i>This… This is…</i></b>

09:51.960 --> 09:54.630
<b><i>Their true feelings are showing!</i></b>

09:55.670 --> 09:57.010
<b>What's so funny?</b>

09:57.090 --> 10:00.260
<b>Would a five-year-old
really smile like this?</b>

10:00.350 --> 10:04.770
<b>Or is Hitori Sonoyama
hidden somewhere in there?</b>

10:05.810 --> 10:06.890
<b><i>Oh no.</i></b>

10:06.980 --> 10:08.900
<b><i>Migi's face always betrays him.</i></b>

10:10.730 --> 10:12.610
<b>You're silly, big brother.</b>

10:13.730 --> 10:16.320
<b>Are we having a staring contest?</b>

10:22.200 --> 10:24.160
<b>Eiji.. This child…</b>

10:25.580 --> 10:27.710
<b>is a perfect five-year-old.</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:43.060
<b><i>This will be the end</i>
<i>of the conditioning program.</i></b>

10:43.140 --> 10:45.520
<b>You may go back home tomorrow.</b>

10:45.600 --> 10:46.730
<b>Huh?</b>

10:46.810 --> 10:49.310
<b>I already told Mr. and Mrs. Sonoyama.</b>

10:49.390 --> 10:52.940
<b>They'll come pick you up
first thing in the morning.</b>

10:53.570 --> 10:56.780
<b>It's late, so stay here for the night.</b>

10:56.860 --> 10:58.820
<b>Make yourself at home,</b>

10:58.900 --> 11:00.740
<b>and enjoy our neighborhood's hospitality.</b>

11:11.830 --> 11:13.130
<b>Migi.</b>

11:14.420 --> 11:15.840
<b>Dali.</b>

11:17.170 --> 11:18.880
<b>It's over.</b>

11:20.380 --> 11:21.180
<b>Dangit.</b>

11:21.260 --> 11:25.100
<b>We only just found
a way to make them spill it all.</b>

11:27.180 --> 11:29.480
<b>Migi?</b>

11:29.560 --> 11:31.100
<b>Are you listening, Migi?</b>

11:31.770 --> 11:33.520
<b>Hey. Migi!</b>

11:35.190 --> 11:36.860
<b>WELL DONE, MY DEAR MIGI AND DALI</b>

11:36.940 --> 11:38.780
<b>What do you think</b>

11:38.860 --> 11:42.110
<b>Mother would doodle
right now if she could?</b>

11:43.700 --> 11:47.200
<b>You silly little ditzy slowpoke?</b>

11:48.250 --> 11:49.750
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

11:49.830 --> 11:52.210
<b>Huh? Dali?</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:56.250
<b>Dali?</b>

12:00.050 --> 12:01.180
<b>She'd write…</b>

12:05.800 --> 12:07.510
<b>〝Don't give up.〞</b>

12:08.060 --> 12:09.680
<b>Dali…</b>

12:10.520 --> 12:13.100
<b>There must be something we can do tonight.</b>

12:13.770 --> 12:14.610
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:18.110 --> 12:20.490
<b>Let's go over what we know.</b>

12:20.570 --> 12:21.400
<b>Yes.</b>

12:22.570 --> 12:26.370
<b><i>Our mother worked as</i>
<i>a housemaid in his house.</i></b>

12:27.370 --> 12:30.620
<b><i>There is a model of</i>
<i>the Oregon Village in the attic</i></b>

12:30.700 --> 12:32.080
<b><i>used to surveil everyone.</i></b>

12:33.120 --> 12:35.250
<b><i>The mother is</i>
<i>carrying out conditioning programs</i></b>

12:35.330 --> 12:38.050
<b><i>whenever the father is not around.</i></b>

12:39.000 --> 12:41.220
<b><i>Eiji occasionally wets his bed.</i></b>

12:41.300 --> 12:42.010
<b><i>That's all.</i></b>

12:44.090 --> 12:45.760
<b>Eiji is the murderer.</b>

12:45.840 --> 12:47.890
<b>Bedwetting can't be the deciding factor.</b>

12:48.390 --> 12:50.970
<b>The mother is obviously
the most fishy one.</b>

12:51.770 --> 12:54.480
<b>The father smells just as much.</b>

12:57.730 --> 13:01.320
<b>We still have no conclusive evidence.</b>

13:02.490 --> 13:05.030
<b>-Mother, oh, Mother.
-Hm?</b>

13:05.110 --> 13:07.910
<b>Who of the mom and dad</b>

13:07.990 --> 13:09.490
<b>is the true culprit?</b>

13:10.080 --> 13:13.910
<b>It's not an Ouija board, you know.</b>

13:15.170 --> 13:16.460
<b>Huh?</b>

13:17.290 --> 13:18.340
<b>That's it.</b>

13:29.300 --> 13:30.260
<b>Oh?</b>

13:32.890 --> 13:34.810
<b>When did the door open?</b>

13:37.600 --> 13:38.440
<b>Huh?</b>

13:56.960 --> 13:58.380
<b><i>How will you escape?</i></b>

13:58.460 --> 14:00.090
<b><i>Just like litmus paper,</i></b>

14:01.090 --> 14:04.010
<b><i>your reaction will reveal your true color.</i></b>

14:05.420 --> 14:08.680
<b><i>Let's start a truly strange investigation.</i></b>

14:17.770 --> 14:19.480
<b>I missed you so much,</b>

14:19.560 --> 14:20.730
<b>Metry.</b>

14:22.110 --> 14:24.610
<b>Where have you been all this time?</b>

14:24.690 --> 14:26.150
<b>I searched everywhere for you.</b>

14:30.570 --> 14:34.120
<b>Metry, are you hurt?</b>

14:36.830 --> 14:37.540
<b>Metry.</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:39.500
<b>Metry!</b>

14:45.920 --> 14:49.340
<b>Mother's name is Metry…</b>

14:49.430 --> 14:52.550
<b>Migi. This means the father is innocent.</b>

14:52.640 --> 14:54.810
<b>Had he been the killer,</b>

14:54.890 --> 14:58.100
<b>he would think he saw a ghost.</b>

14:59.020 --> 15:02.560
<b><i>But instead of being scared,</i>
<i>he embraced you.</i></b>

15:04.400 --> 15:06.070
<b>Looks like our mother</b>

15:06.150 --> 15:08.530
<b>was his mistress.</b>

15:09.740 --> 15:11.490
<b>His mistress?</b>

15:11.570 --> 15:13.030
<b>Does that mean…</b>

15:14.160 --> 15:16.200
<b>That man is our father?!</b>

15:16.290 --> 15:19.330
<b>Ssh! Don't get distracted!</b>

15:20.500 --> 15:22.710
<b>If the father is innocent,</b>

15:22.790 --> 15:24.960
<b>through process of elimination,
the killer is…</b>

15:54.320 --> 15:55.490
<b>Metry.</b>

15:56.030 --> 15:57.540
<b>Is that you?</b>

16:03.630 --> 16:05.460
<b>You finally came to steal it.</b>

16:10.090 --> 16:11.260
<b>She ran.</b>

16:11.930 --> 16:13.300
<b>Did you hear that?</b>

16:13.390 --> 16:15.800
<b>That piercing scream…</b>

16:15.890 --> 16:17.260
<b>Yes.</b>

16:17.350 --> 16:19.810
<b>That wasn't a reaction to seeing a human.</b>

16:22.520 --> 16:24.440
<b><i>There's no doubting that</i></b>

16:24.520 --> 16:26.150
<b><i>the killer is…</i></b>

16:32.360 --> 16:33.660
<b><i>Run!</i></b>

16:47.880 --> 16:49.130
<b>Hey, Dali.</b>

16:49.210 --> 16:51.300
<b>Can you kill a ghost with scissors?</b>

16:51.380 --> 16:54.930
<b>No… She's ready to hunt a human.</b>

16:55.010 --> 16:57.390
<b>-Does that mean she's innocent too?!
-Sssh!</b>

17:16.910 --> 17:18.740
<b>What are you doing, Reiko?</b>

17:18.830 --> 17:20.620
<b>Oh. Darling.</b>

17:20.700 --> 17:22.370
<b>Have you seen Metry?</b>

17:22.450 --> 17:24.540
<b>Put down the scissor.</b>

17:24.620 --> 17:25.750
<b>Why?</b>

17:25.830 --> 17:26.830
<b>Just do it.</b>

17:26.920 --> 17:29.090
<b>Come to your senses, Reiko.</b>

17:29.170 --> 17:30.500
<b>Metry is not here.</b>

17:30.590 --> 17:33.380
<b>Are you sure you're not hiding her?</b>

17:33.470 --> 17:34.800
<b>Just put down the scissor.</b>

17:34.880 --> 17:37.890
<b>Give it to me, okay?</b>

17:56.860 --> 17:57.910
<b>Metry!</b>

18:02.160 --> 18:04.410
<b>Eiji, what do you think is happening?</b>

18:04.500 --> 18:06.960
<b>Is it a robber?</b>

18:07.040 --> 18:08.630
<b>I'll go check.</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.920
<b>No, you can't do that.</b>

18:11.000 --> 18:13.630
<b>Mom said to
not open the door no matter what.</b>

18:13.710 --> 18:16.930
<b>What will you do
if something happens to Mom?</b>

18:19.510 --> 18:21.850
<b>Hurry up, Migi. We have to go back.</b>

18:23.180 --> 18:24.810
<b>But…</b>

18:27.850 --> 18:28.940
<b>Beast.</b>

18:56.130 --> 18:58.010
<b><i>Eiji? Damnit.</i></b>

18:58.090 --> 19:00.140
<b><i>Why is he here?</i></b>

19:00.220 --> 19:02.350
<b><i>Is this the end?</i></b>

19:10.100 --> 19:12.980
<b>It's… a ghost…</b>

19:22.120 --> 19:23.030
<b>What?</b>

19:25.660 --> 19:27.660
<b>This can't be.</b>

19:28.330 --> 19:30.370
<b>How can Eiji be</b>

19:31.750 --> 19:33.380
<b>the guilty one?</b>

19:35.090 --> 19:36.510
<b>Eiji?</b>

19:36.590 --> 19:38.470
<b>What happened, Eiji?</b>

19:41.260 --> 19:43.390
<b>Welcome back, Hitori.</b>

19:43.470 --> 19:44.850
<b>I'm home,</b>

19:44.930 --> 19:46.720
<b>Dad. Mom.</b>

19:46.810 --> 19:49.730
<b>We waited so long for this day.</b>

19:49.810 --> 19:51.140
<b>You know, your mom</b>

19:51.230 --> 19:54.570
<b>was so desperate she was
about to sneak into that house.</b>

19:54.650 --> 19:55.730
<b>Oh, no.</b>

19:55.820 --> 19:59.860
<b>Weren't you the one reading
books on ninjas night after night?</b>

19:59.950 --> 20:00.950
<b>-Me too.
-Huh?</b>

20:01.030 --> 20:04.410
<b>I was waiting for a chance to
infiltrate them from above.</b>

20:15.420 --> 20:19.800
<b><i>Seems like the secrets of</i>
<i>the Ichijo family have come full circle…</i></b>

20:21.430 --> 20:22.590
<b><i>Hitori.</i></b>

20:22.680 --> 20:25.470
<b>Don't ever keep quiet
about things that burden you.</b>

20:25.550 --> 20:27.390
<b>That's right, Hitori.</b>

20:27.470 --> 20:30.060
<b>Food you share is the best too, right?</b>

20:30.140 --> 20:33.560
<b>We should share
all our emotions with each other too.</b>

20:33.650 --> 20:35.110
<b>Because we're family.</b>

20:35.190 --> 20:38.730
<b>Joy, sadness and pain.</b>

20:38.820 --> 20:41.400
<b>And warmth as well.</b>

20:42.990 --> 20:44.450
<b>Warmth…</b>

20:48.740 --> 20:49.750
<b><i>Dali.</i></b>

20:52.790 --> 20:53.620
<b>Hitori.</b>

20:54.290 --> 20:57.090
<b>I feel chilly all of a sudden.</b>

20:57.170 --> 20:58.920
<b>Oh no!</b>

21:06.180 --> 21:07.140
<b>Huh?</b>

21:07.220 --> 21:10.470
<b>You must've been so tense at the Ichijos,
you were all worn out.</b>

21:10.560 --> 21:14.060
<b>Have some cherry pie
and you'll feel better.</b>

21:17.650 --> 21:19.570
<b>Here, say 〝aah.〞</b>

21:22.740 --> 21:24.320
<b><i>He really made me…</i></b>

21:24.400 --> 21:27.410
<b><i>waste this time playing happy family.</i></b>

21:28.120 --> 21:30.450
<b><i>This unnecessary play pretend</i>…</b>

21:32.080 --> 21:34.330
<b>Did you know that cherries</b>

21:34.410 --> 21:37.080
<b>have anti-aging effects?</b>

21:37.920 --> 21:40.000
<b>It's polyphenol.</b>

23:14.520 --> 23:16.020
<b>Oh, Eiji.</b>

23:16.100 --> 23:17.890
<b>You're forgetting to eat.</b>

23:18.480 --> 23:21.190
<b>Is my cooking not to your liking?</b>

23:21.270 --> 23:22.400
<b>That's not it.</b>
